163+  00E5              P126_NGS_PG1_PORT     EQU #21
164+  00E5              ; Project125 hardware-parity diagnostic locations. WIN1 is physical page 03;
165+  00E5              ; its operational stack is at logical 7FFEh (physical offset 3FFEh). The two
166+  00E5              ; 274-byte smoke buffers at logical 5000h and 6000h (physical D000h and E000h) do not overlap that stack.
167+  00E5              ; These are diagnostic carve-outs only; production ABI staging remains page 42h.
